      "fields": {
        "body": "# Quality policy {#quality-policy}\n\nWe ship small changes often, each one reviewed, tested and traceable from request to release.\n\n## Principles {#principles}\n\n- Every change starts as a backlog item.\n- Nothing ships without a passed acceptance test.\n- Releases are approved by the head of product.\n",
        "owner": "01900000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d003",
        "title": "Quality policy"
      },
