      "fields": {
        "body": "# Document control {#document-control}\n\nDocuments in this manual are drafted together and released as versions. A released version is never changed; a new one replaces it.\n\nThey follow the [principles](kuria:DOCS-1-D01#principles) of the quality policy.\n\n## Review {#review}\n\nThe owner reviews each document once a year, and after every change to the process it describes.\n",
        "owner": "01900000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d003",
        "title": "Document control"
      },
