    {
      "attachments": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-11-17T10:50:10.164715Z",
      "fields": {
        "body": "# Release procedure {#release-procedure}\n\n![The release process](kuria:IMG-1)\n\n1. Plan the release and its backlog.\n2. Freeze features and cut a release candidate.\n3. Run the acceptance test protocol against the candidate; a failed test rejects it.\n4. Write the release notes and have them approved.\n5. Get the go from the head of product, and release.\n6. Close the release once its hotfixes are deployed.\n\nDocuments are kept as [document control](kuria:DOCS-1-D02#review) says.\n",
        "owner": "01900000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d003",
        "title": "Release procedure"
      },
      "id": "01a1e920-e776-7126-8afe-b21d589065cd",
      "number": "DOCS-1-D03",
      "rank": "a4",
      "revisions": [
        {
          "author": "01900000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d002",
          "changes": {
            "body": "# Release procedure {#release-procedure}\n\n![The release process](kuria:IMG-1)\n\n1. Plan the release and its backlog.\n2. Freeze features and cut a release candidate.\n3. Run the acceptance test protocol against the candidate.\n4. Write the release notes and have them approved.\n5. Get the go from the head of product, and release.\n\nDocuments are kept as [document control](kuria:DOCS-1-D02#review) says.\n",
            "owner": "01900000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d003",
            "title": "Release procedure"
